msgstr "正在檢查大物件"

#: version.c:77 version.c:450
#, c-format
msgid "warning"
msgstr "warning"

#: version.c:79
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Your installation contains large objects.  The new database has an\n"
"additional large object permission table.  After upgrading, you will be\n"
"given a command to populate the pg_largeobject_metadata table with\n"
"default permissions.\n"
"\n"
msgstr "\n您的安裝包含大物件。新資料庫有一個附加的大物件權限表。\n升級後，將向您提供一個命令，以使用預設權限填充\npg_largeobject_metadata 表。\n\n"

#: version.c:85
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Your installation contains large objects.  The new database has an\n"
"additional large object permission table, so default permissions must be\n"
"defined for all large objects.  The file\n"
"    %s\n"
"when executed by psql by the database superuser will set the default\n"
"permissions.\n"
"\n"
msgstr "\n您的安裝包含大物件。新資料庫有一個附加的大物件權限表，\n因此必須為所有大物件定義預設權限。\n以資料庫超級使用者身分，透過 psql 執行檔案\n    %s\n即可設定預設權限。\n\n"

#: version.c:272
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for incompatible \"line\" data type"
msgstr "檢查不相容的 \"line\" 資料型別"

#: version.c:279
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains the \"line\" data type in user tables.\n"
"This data type changed its internal and input/output format\n"
"between your old and new versions so this\n"
"cluster cannot currently be upgraded.  You can\n"
"drop the problem columns and restart the upgrade.\n"
"A list of the problem columns is in the file:\n"
"    %s\n"
"\n"
msgstr "您的安裝在使用者表中包含 \"line\" 資料型別。\n該資料型別的內部格式及輸入/輸出格式在舊版本與新版本之間已發生變化，\n因此目前不能升級此叢集。可以刪除有問題的列，然後重新開始升級。\n有問題的列的清單位於檔案:\n    %s\n\n"

#: version.c:310
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for invalid \"unknown\" user columns"
msgstr "檢查無效的 \"unknown\" 使用者欄位"

#: version.c:317
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains the \"unknown\" data type in user tables.\n"
"This data type is no longer allowed in tables, so this\n"
"cluster cannot currently be upgraded.  You can\n"
"drop the problem columns and restart the upgrade.\n"
"A list of the problem columns is in the file:\n"
"    %s\n"
"\n"
msgstr "您的安裝在使用者表中包含 \"unknown\" 資料型別。\n表中已不再允許使用此資料型別，因此目前不能升級此叢集。\n可以刪除有問題的列，然後重新開始升級。\n有問題的列的清單位於檔案:\n    %s\n\n"

#: version.c:372
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for hash indexes"
msgstr "檢查雜湊索引"

#: version.c:452
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Your installation contains hash indexes.  These indexes have different\n"
"internal formats between your old and new clusters, so they must be\n"
"reindexed with the REINDEX command.  After upgrading, you will be given\n"
"REINDEX instructions.\n"
"\n"
msgstr "\n您的安裝中包含雜湊索引。這些索引在新舊叢集中的\n內部格式不同，因此必須使用 REINDEX 命令\n重建。升級完成後，將提供 REINDEX 操作說明。\n\n"

#: version.c:458
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Your installation contains hash indexes.  These indexes have different\n"
"internal formats between your old and new clusters, so they must be\n"
"reindexed with the REINDEX command.  The file\n"
"    %s\n"
"when executed by psql by the database superuser will recreate all invalid\n"
"indexes; until then, none of these indexes will be used.\n"
"\n"
msgstr "\n您的安裝中包含雜湊索引。這些索引在新舊叢集中的\n內部格式不同，因此必須使用 REINDEX 命令\n重建。以資料庫超級使用者身分，透過 psql 執行檔案\n    %s\n即可重建所有無效索引；在此之前，這些索引均不會被使用。\n\n"

#: version.c:484
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for invalid \"sql_identifier\" user columns"
msgstr "檢查無效的 \"sql_identifier\" 使用者欄位"

#: version.c:492
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains the \"sql_identifier\" data type in user tables.\n"
"The on-disk format for this data type has changed, so this\n"
"cluster cannot currently be upgraded.  You can\n"
"drop the problem columns and restart the upgrade.\n"
"A list of the problem columns is in the file:\n"
"    %s\n"
"\n"
msgstr "您的安裝在使用者表中包含 \"sql_identifier\" 資料型別。\n該資料型別的磁碟格式已變更，因此目前不能升級此叢集。\n可以刪除有問題的列，然後重新開始升級。\n有問題的列的清單位於檔案:\n    %s\n\n"

#: version.c:516
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for extension updates"
msgstr "檢查擴充模組更新"

#: version.c:568
#, c-format
msgid "notice"
msgstr "notice"

#: version.c:569
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Your installation contains extensions that should be updated\n"
"with the ALTER EXTENSION command.  The file\n"
"    %s\n"
"when executed by psql by the database superuser will update\n"
"these extensions.\n"
"\n"
msgstr "\n您的安裝中包含建議使用 ALTER EXTENSION 命令更新的擴充模組。\n以資料庫超級使用者身分，透過 psql 執行檔案\n    %s\n即可更新這些擴充模組。\n\n"

